  "id": "USN-8091-1",
  "summary": "util-linux vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the util-linux su utility did not drop capabilities\nwhen being used with the --pty option. While not a security issue by\nitself, a local attacker could possibly use the su tool to exploit\nvulnerabilities in other applications.",
